# ============================================================================
# Test API - Transactions & Commissions
# ============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001/api
@token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### COMMISSIONS - Configuration des taux (2 % par défaut)
GET {{baseUrl}}/commissions/config
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### COMMISSIONS - Modifier la configuration (ADMIN/MANAGER)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/commissions/config
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "commissionRate": 0.02,
  "agentShareRate": 0
}

### COMMISSIONS - Preview : 250 000 DT × 2 % → 5 000 DT (100 % agence si agentShareRate=0)
GET {{baseUrl}}/commissions/calculate-preview?amount=250000&commissionRate=0.02&agentShareRate=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### TRANSACTIONS - Créer (commission auto-calculée)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "propertyId": "clx123abc",
  "clientId": "clx456def",
  "ownerId": "clx789ghi",
  "agentId": "clx012jkl",
  "transactionType": "SALE",
  "amount": 250000,
  "date": "2026-10-12T10:00:00Z",
  "status": "COMPLETED",
  "createCommission": true,
  "notes": "Vente appartement 3 pièces"
}

### COMMISSIONS - Liste
GET {{baseUrl}}/commissions?page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### COMMISSIONS - Filtre statut paiement
GET {{baseUrl}}/commissions?paymentStatus=PENDING
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### COMMISSIONS - Stats
GET {{baseUrl}}/commissions/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### COMMISSIONS - Créer manuellement (montants calculés côté serveur)
POST {{baseUrl}}/commissions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transactionId": "clxTRANSACTION_ID",
  "commissionRate": 0.02,
  "agentShareRate": 0.5,
  "notes": "Commission manuelle"
}

### COMMISSIONS - Marquer comme payée
PUT {{baseUrl}}/commissions/clxCOMMISSION_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "paymentStatus": "PAID",
  "paidAt": "2026-10-12T14:30:00Z"
}
